# Agent notices: the toast over the terminal and the system notification.
# Their titles and bodies come from the daemon; these are the app's own.

# The title of a notice the daemon sent without one.
notifications-untitled = 通知

# QA > Notifications previews a toast or a system notification of each kind.
notifications-preview-attention = 需要关注
notifications-preview-attention-body = QA 预览：智能体正在等待您输入。
notifications-preview-finished = 已完成
notifications-preview-finished-body = QA 预览：智能体已完成任务。
notifications-preview-update = 更新已安装
notifications-preview-update-body = 仅为 QA 预览。未安装更新。
notifications-preview-custom = 自定义通知
notifications-preview-custom-body = QA 预览：自定义通知消息。
